    // ---- crystalized-essence consumables (ADR-0149, ADR-0176 D6) ---------
    // Items id=4 and id=5 were slice B's discrete evolution TRIGGERS. That
    // role is deleted with EvolutionTrigger itself (EG1/ADR-0174); under the
    // essence-graph model they are essence SOURCES instead, consumed by
    // consume_crystalized_essence (EG2-4). They still carry NO
    // recruit/train/cure fields — rule R9 requires an essence item to be
    // single-role, and validate_evolution_paths rejects the combination.
    //
    // Each grants exactly the amount its item-assisted evolution edge
    // requires (edge=6 Water 100, edge=8 Fire 100 in
    // evolution_paths/000-core.ron), so one feed clears the bar in a single
    // use — the old trigger's one-shot-unlock feel, preserved (EG3-8).
    //
    // NOW STOCKED in shops/000-core.ron at 500, retiring ADR-0149 D5/D6's
    // deliberate non-stocking; its stated condition was "stock these once a
    // reducer can consume them", and EG2-4 is that reducer.
    //
    // COMMENT HYGIENE (gated by pt_d3_tuning.rs t6, which scans this directory
    // for id-shaped needles in BOTH line and block comments): full-line
    // comments only, and use the "id=N" form when naming a stable content id.
